{ Finegold's Reti lesson repeatedly values fianchettoes and central control over automatic pawn occupation. Against ...b6, answer with your own fianchetto, then decide when d4/c4 should claim space. }
1. Nf3 b6 2. g3
{ Meet a queenside fianchetto with calm development. Bg2 contests the long diagonal immediately. }
( 2. d4
