1... c6 ( 1... Nc6
{ Against the Black Mustang style ...Nc6, occupy the center. Do not be hypnotized by the unusual label. }
2. d4 d6 3. e4
{ e4 is the clean answer when Black has not challenged d4 directly. } 3... Nf6
4. Nc3 e5 5. d5
{ Push d5 when it gains space and leaves Black's knights searching for squares. }
5... Ne7 6. Be2 Ng6 7. O-O ) ( 1... Nc6
